#10401
A Bamboo Forest~
   You find yourself ankle-deep in water, large stalks of bamboo growing all
around you. Each stalk varies in length but the majority have grown to at
least 8 feet tall, swaying softly in a light breeze. They part easily as you
move about, hitting other stalks with a soft "clunk".
~
