#10402
A Bamboo Forest~
   As you push your way further into this bamboo forest, you stumble upon a
small clearing, bamboo stalks cut down to just above water level. It would
appear as if the bamboo had been farmed and taken away for whatever purpose
the nearby city of Kir Oshi demanded of it.
