#10434
Beneath the Footbridge~
   You crouch low in the water so as to avoid hitting your head on the above
footbridge. It's relatively narrow and constructed of solid wood, providing
access to an elegant house you can see situated in the middle of the pond.
You will need to swim to the east or west before being able to move further.
~
